 ## 빌드·검사
 - iOS: `cd ios-app && xcodebuild -project NaeiloApp.xcodeproj -target NaeiloApp -sdk iphonesimulator CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO build 2>&1 | grep -E "error|FAIL" | head -50`
